                        "sense_id": "81cba656-cf63-39bf-991d-d2a1556850d4",
                        "entry_id": "4b4378eb-a027-3daf-8b81-81076fbad32b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Esprit de révolte et d’usurpation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53511781-079f-4ff0-affc-d9f0bc58afcd",
                                "sense_id": "81cba656-cf63-39bf-991d-d2a1556850d4",
                                "text": "Conserver à la maison régnante l’éclat de sa prérogative si uniquement distinctive, et la tranquillité intérieure de l’État, du péril du titanisme et des dangereuses secousses qu’il ne peut manquer d’en recevoir."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77e16e85-1be2-42a7-8d51-c340e0405cb5",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b4378eb-a027-3daf-8b81-81076fbad32b",
                        "source_sense_id": "81cba656-cf63-39bf-991d-d2a1556850d4",
                        "target_lang_word": "Titanismus",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Titanismus",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86fea958-9bce-3037-86b4-9260622bbcf7",
                                        "entry_id": "5c6d1b90-f800-3d84-a7d0-e4b8e55d88b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Haltung des energischen bis trotzigen Widerstands eines Individuums gegenüber einer unüberwindlichen Macht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Literaturgeschichte/Geistesgeschichte"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc2009ae-7d04-4e90-bbbc-1320c7bf4bed",
                                                "sense_id": "86fea958-9bce-3037-86b4-9260622bbcf7",
                                                "text": "„Hätte seine [J. W. v. Goethes] robuste physische Constitution ihm aber nicht das Ausruhen einer so langen Lebensdauer zur Schöpfung seines größten Werkes [gemeint ist ›Faust‹] gewährt, so würde er ewig als ein Abtrünniger vor uns stehen, der den Titanismus seiner Jugend nicht zu bewahren wußte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "196d6d50-5dd0-4374-85d6-b75c7bb300a0",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b4378eb-a027-3daf-8b81-81076fbad32b",
                        "source_sense_id": "81cba656-cf63-39bf-991d-d2a1556850d4",
                        "target_lang_word": "titanism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "titanism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a39b89de-61bb-3a63-965e-895ae2431021",
                                        "entry_id": "5f05441a-e302-37e7-94d7-48e187dcef09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nonconformism; rebellion against prevailing social and artistic conventions, especially when it involves grandiosity or hubris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b85e863-acde-486f-a198-5bff1abcfa33",
                                                "sense_id": "a39b89de-61bb-3a63-965e-895ae2431021",
                                                "text": "We will do well not to understand too quickly what is being fought there beneath curse and entreaty, prayer and blasphemy, as our own; not to classify it too nimbly as an ancient version of one of our modern religious titanisms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b0f741a-129e-4427-a21a-fb45d1986371",
                                                "sense_id": "a39b89de-61bb-3a63-965e-895ae2431021",
                                                "text": "For Cerny, too, modern subjectivism, specifically moral subjectivism, is also the source of titanism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eef57d6a-11dc-49cc-a250-a22f29bd032d",
                                                "sense_id": "a39b89de-61bb-3a63-965e-895ae2431021",
                                                "text": "Sexual titanism is always weakness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e167975-e1fc-4612-8743-172fc6e2e605",
                                                "sense_id": "a39b89de-61bb-3a63-965e-895ae2431021",
                                                "text": "Critics have argued that Frankenstein is a protest against Romantic titanism, against the masculine aggressiveness that lies concealed beneath the dreams of Romantic idealism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
